@page "/"
@page "/Home"
@page "/Home/Index"

<PageTitle>Home Page - eShopLite</PageTitle>

<section class="hero mb-5" aria-labelledby="title">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Outdoor gear storefront</span>
        <h1 id="title" class="display-5 fw-semibold">eShopLite</h1>
        <p class="lead">
            A small outdoor-gear storefront: browse and search a product catalogue, open a product
            for the full details, add items to a cart, check out as a signed-in user, and look back
            over everything you have ordered.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="Home/Products" class="btn btn-light btn-lg d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                Browse products <Icon Name="arrow-right" Size="18" />
            </a>
            <a href="Home/Stores" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg">Find a store</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="Images/product9.png" alt="" class="hero-img hero-img-main" />
        <img src="Images/product5.png" alt="" class="hero-img hero-img-side" />
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <section class="feature-card h-100" aria-labelledby="shopTitle">
            <span class="feature-icon"><Icon Name="bag" /></span>
            <h2 id="shopTitle" class="h4">Shop</h2>
            <p>
                Search the catalogue by name or description, open any product for its full details, then
                pick a quantity and add to your cart. The cart lives in your session, so it survives
                signing in and follows you until you check out.
            </p>
            <a class="feature-link" href="Home/Products">Products <Icon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" /></a>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <section class="feature-card h-100" aria-labelledby="storesTitle">
            <span class="feature-icon"><Icon Name="store" /></span>
            <h2 id="storesTitle" class="h4">Stores</h2>
            <p>
                Nine locations, each with its own city and opening hours &mdash; the physical side of
                the catalogue.
            </p>
            <a class="feature-link" href="Home/Stores">Stores <Icon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" /></a>
        </section>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
        <section class="feature-card h-100" aria-labelledby="ordersTitle">
            <span class="feature-icon"><Icon Name="receipt" /></span>
            <h2 id="ordersTitle" class="h4">Your orders</h2>
            <p>
                Every order you have placed, newest first, with a running lifetime total and a link
                back to each receipt. Sign in to see yours &mdash; you only ever see your own.
            </p>
            <a class="feature-link" href="Order">My orders <Icon Name="arrow-right" Size="16" /></a>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-4 info-panels">
    <section class="col-md-6" aria-labelledby="aboutTitle">
        <h2 id="aboutTitle" class="h5">About eShopLite</h2>
        <p>
            Everything the storefront does is reachable from the tabs above: <strong>Products</strong>
            for the catalogue and product details, <strong>Stores</strong> for our locations and
            opening hours, and <strong>My orders</strong> for your order history once you are
            signed in.
        </p>
    </section>
    <section class="col-md-6" aria-labelledby="signInTitle">
        <h2 id="signInTitle" class="h5">Signing in</h2>
        <p>Browsing and adding to the cart are open to everyone; checkout requires an account. Once you are signed in, your past orders are available under <strong>My orders</strong>.</p>
    </section>
</div>
